    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to &quot;Cooktopia&quot;!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve been chosen to restore taste to Rainbow Island\u2014a world stripped of all flavor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From planting your first seed to cooking wildly imaginative dishes;<br>From reviving community kitchens to hosting legendary feasts;<br>Immerse yourself in farming, fishing, mining, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into quirky minigames, experiment with professions, and rebuild a vibrant utopia bursting with color and hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just a game\u2014it\u2019s about connecting hearts through food and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When flavor fades, YOU become the rainbow.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore daily surprises, lively festivals, and ever-changing adventures.<br>Open this world with excitement\u2014every moment promises joy and magic!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to &quot;Cooktopia&quot;!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve been chosen to restore taste to Rainbow Island\u2014a world stripped of all flavor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From planting your first seed to cooking wildly imaginative dishes;<br>From reviving community kitchens to hosting legendary feasts;<br>Immerse yourself in farming, fishing, mining, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into quirky minigames, experiment with professions, and rebuild a vibrant utopia bursting with color and hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just a game\u2014it\u2019s about connecting hearts through food and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When flavor fades, YOU become the rainbow.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore daily surprises, lively festivals, and ever-changing adventures.<br>Open this world with excitement\u2014every moment promises joy and magic!</p>",
    "short_description": "A cozy simulation game blending farming, animal care, and cooking. it invites you to a cheerful, colorful world where you shape your utopia through a simple yet dynamic economy. Enjoy quick, satisfying gameplay sessions as you grow crops, cook dishes, and build your dream community!",
